OL,3,GNEWSASale of tapestry tickets for
OL,4,AHastings residents opens
OL,5,
OL,6,FA priority sales window to buy tickets
OL,7,Fto see the Bayeux Tapestry in London
OL,8,Fhas opened for people living near the
OL,9,Fsite of the Battle of Hastings.
OL,11,FA two-day booking window for residents
OL,12,Fto see the historic work at the British
OL,13,FMuseum opened at 10:00 BST on Monday.
OL,15,FThe early medieval masterpiece, which
OL,16,Ftells the story of the events leading
OL,17,Fup to 1066 and the Norman Conquest, has
OL,18,Fbeen loaned to the UK as part of an
OL,19,Fagreement with France, and will open to
OL,20,Fthe public until 11 July next year.
OL,23,APub: 19-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
