OL,3,GNEWSASale of tapestry tickets for
OL,4,AHastings residents opens
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople living near to the site of the
OL,7,Ffamous battle can book by calling the
OL,8,FBritish Museum box office and they will
OL,9,Fneed to give a postcode and use a
OL,10,Fpayment card registered to a Hastings
OL,11,For Rother billing address.
